=== ROOM 51: THE COMMAND ASSEMBLER ===

The Command Assembler's workshop is scattered with orphaned parts.
Each part file in the parts/ directory contains a numeric VALUE.
You must assemble them all using xargs to find the total.

MISSION:
1. List all .part files: find parts/ -name "*.part"
2. Use xargs to extract VALUE= lines from each file:
   find parts/ -name "*.part" | xargs grep -h "VALUE="
3. Cut the numbers: | cut -d= -f2
4. Sum them: | paste -sd+ | bc
5. Submit the sum: ./getKey.sh <your_answer>

MASTER PIPELINE:
   find parts/ -name "*.part" | xargs grep -h "VALUE=" | cut -d= -f2 | paste -sd+ | bc

KEY COMMANDS:
   xargs -I{} cmd {}      Replace {} with each input item
   xargs -n N cmd         Pass N args per command execution
   xargs -P N cmd         Run N parallel processes
   xargs -0 cmd           Null-separated input (safe for spaces)
   find . -print0 | xargs -0 cmd   Null-safe pattern
   xargs -t cmd           Print each command before executing

To decrypt room_52 when you have the password:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 \
     -in ../room_52/README -out ../room_52/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD
   cat ../room_52/README.txt
